# Applications Rules

## General Structure
- All applications are located in `apps/`.
- Each app is a separate package in the monorepo.
- Apps should not import directly from other apps, only from `packages/`.

## Ports
- `apps/web`: 5173 (Vite default)
- `apps/site`: 5174 (or configured)
- `apps/docs`: 3000 or 3010
- `apps/api`: 3000 (NestJS) -> likely conflicts in dev, check configurations.
- `apps/accounts`: 4200 (Angular default)

## Configuration
- Apps should load environment variables from `.env` files.
- `package.json` names should be scoped `@open-urbis/<app-name>` if possible, or simple names if strictly internal.

## Dependencies
- Use `workspace:*` for internal packages.
- Common UI components should come from `@open-urbis/map-ui`.
